WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:03.710
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.042
- Hey Drew, this is Sergeant Griswold,

00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:07.096
stationed at Fort Sill, Oklahoma.

00:00:07.096 --> 00:00:09.208
- Hi Drew, I'm PFC Khalan Moore,

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.770
I'm stationed at Fort Bliss, Texas.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.755
- I'd like to give a shout
out to my wife and son.

00:00:13.755 --> 00:00:16.680
I love you guys, and I
can't wait to be home.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.710
- I'd like to send a shout out

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:20.165
to my mom Dalia in Houston, Texas.

00:00:20.165 --> 00:00:23.300
Hi mom, I hope you're having
a great day, I love you.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.850
- Hey Drew, this is
Sergeant Matthew Samelak,

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.840
stationed out of Fort Sill, Oklahoma.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.965
- Hi Drew, my name is
Master Sergeant Maddox,

00:00:30.965 --> 00:00:33.960
I'm stationed at Fort Hood, Texas.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.030
- Hi Drew, my name is
Specialist Omar Gomez,

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.800
currently stationed overseas.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.914
- I'd love to give a shout out to my mom.

00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:42.270
I don't get to see her very often,

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.730
but I sorely miss her home cooking.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.210
Love you, mom, can't wait to see you soon.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.166
- 'Cause I wanna give a quick shout out

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:51.020
to my family back at
home, I love you guys.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.230
- Just wanna give a shout
out to my wife, Jenny,

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.292
my parents, Eric and
Sue, my sister, Megan.

00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:56.899
I hope you guys have a great holidays.

00:00:56.899 --> 00:00:59.647
I miss you guys and love you
guys, and I'll be home soon.

00:00:59.647 --> 00:01:02.230
(upbeat music)

